      "id": "task_bfe056ab4e9349d7",
      "workspace_id": "ws_50a315301f434e6b",
      "title": "Get incident-commander approval for proposed route rollback, then revert chg-eu-2048 to checkout-v1-eu",
      "description": "Next action for the on-call teammate. 1) Incident commander reviews proposed decision dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b. 2) On approval (accept_decision), execute the rollback of the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit route from checkout-v2-eu back to checkout-v1-eu. 3) Keep rollout-842 paused until checkout-v2-eu has registered healthy endpoints. 4) Verify 503 rate for eu-orders-submit-5xx returns to baseline. Do NOT accept the decision or execute the change without explicit approval; no production change is authorized in this exercise. If instead checkout-v2-eu is intended to serve, the alternative is to complete endpoint registration for rollout-842 before re-cutting -- do not re-cut the route to an upstream with zero healthy endpoints.",
